# 🚀 Day 29 – Operation Lifeline: Supply Chain Crisis Lab

## 📌 Challenge Overview

Day 29 focused on building **Operation Lifeline**, an interactive **Supply Chain Crisis Management Simulator** using **Claude AI**. The application simulates real-world supply chain disruptions where users take the role of a supply chain leader and make strategic decisions to protect business operations.

This project combines business strategy, crisis management, negotiation, leadership, and AI-driven decision-making into a gamified learning experience.

---

# 🏭 Project Description

**Operation Lifeline: Supply Chain Crisis Lab**

A single-page React application that allows users to experience supply chain crisis management through interactive simulations, supplier negotiations, executive decisions, and AI investment strategies.

Each simulation generates unique companies, crises, and business outcomes to create a new learning experience every time.

